  "description": "Why I am still bearish on oil. Also, Index and Gold Coverage",
  "body_html": "<p>Good morning and happy Tuesday, we started the week off strong, making a new all time high with S&amp;P 500 futures yesterday. Its pretty interesting, making all time highs, yet I can physically feel that not many people are excited. There is a lot of skepticism, doubt and disbelief, likely stemming from an overconsumption of mainstream media headlines that have largely painted a grim picture most of the time. </p><p>Stocks love to climb a wall of worry; and trend is friend. </p><p>Ignore the news. Follow the trend. </p><p>The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/going-shopping-3-finance-stocks-im?r=4z8lgl\">Finance Stocks we picked up</a> back in January and <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/62-days-of-waiting-is-over-the-1st?r=4z8lgl\">compounded our position by buying more</a>, 2 of the 3 have also made all time highs, with the 3rd in the green, still coiling for a bigger move upwards. These have not “exploded” in growth, but have been steady, quiet climbers upwards. I still expect a much larger move out of them in the months to come. I have repeatedly emphasized the financial sector looks primed for a large move. </p><p>Both the S&amp;P 500 and the Russell 2000 have cooled off slightly today, though nothing worrisome, at the time of writing. After 4 weeks of going upwards, this is to be expected. </p><p>I keep getting pinged about oil… people seeing, or possibly hoping…if I have changed my bearish oil stance. I have not. My forecast of $30 a barrel, albeit slowly, remains. Yes, I am aware this is not profitable territory for the industry. My article about <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-oil-trap?r=4z8lgl\">Oil being a Retail Bull Trap</a>, has now been accurate for 49 days. Does this piss some people off and go against the mainstream narrative? Yea. Could I be wrong? Of course, I do not have a crystal ball, nor does anyone. Primary reasons my bearish call on oil remains:</p><ol><li><p>I once talked to a real oil expert/trader (not that faker on TikTok, that has made up, or incredibly stretched the truth, his entire career, yet few people actually research him. He makes pretty decent content, but getting oil predictions from him is the equivalent of asking a Starbucks barista where they think coffee futures are going). No, I am not an oil expert. But the single best indication of where oil prices are going is oil rig count. Largely, if rig counts are going up, then likely, your trend is up. The inverse applies as well. This seems to hold accurate when you compare rig counts<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> to actual price action (I have). As you can see in the image below, rig counts have trended downwards from 2025 to 2026. They started to fall from 2022 to 2023, in the 780’s, when I first put my foot down publicly, being bearish on oil. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Pi-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Pi-!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Pi-!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Pi-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Pi-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Pi-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:611384,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/195761496?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Pi-!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Pi-!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Pi-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Pi-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dd78bb5-f987-4fd7-ba14-de59ee12b672_1600x900.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Rig counts trending downwards still, into 2026</figcaption></figure></div></li><li><p>The trend is still down. Yea, you had a massive<strong> news</strong> pump with the Strait of Hormuz being closed/open/closed/open… but zooming out to the macro time frame, we yet again, see lower highs and lower lows. This $30 a barrel prediction is not for short term (daily) traders, because again, you can get spikes. The only thing we are seeing on the longer timeframes though, is weakness. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6nT8!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6nT8!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6nT8!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6nT8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6nT8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6nT8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png\" width=\"1432\" height=\"854\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:854,&quot;width&quot;:1432,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:223914,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/195761496?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6nT8!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6nT8!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6nT8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6nT8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F00a557d3-110e-4087-9305-06de8790aa4e_1432x854.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Trend is down. Yes you have news spikes…but on a macro scale, lower highs and lower lows.</figcaption></figure></div></li><li><p>“Everyone” thinks oil is going to skyrocket, particularly newer traders and even non-traders, your regular Joes and Janes that don’t invest. I love this scenario as an investor… “everyone” is usually wrong. <strong>Do you really think “everyone” is going to make tons of money, because oil is “guaranteed” to go up?</strong> Maybe…incredibly unlikely though. I doubt insiders are just going to hand over money to retail. </p></li><li><p>Catalysts drop oil…for example the April 2020 collapse of oil prices, all the way down to NEGATIVE, -$40.32. We have so many catalysts and potential black swans flying up above…I think it would nearly be foolish to think one of them won’t swoop down, unexpectedly. No, I have no idea what it will be. Maybe aliens or nukes or whatever. But I am betting a catalyst will come to crash the prices. </p><ol><li><p>This will work out well down the road…can’t rebuild America or “make America great again” (no I am not MAGA) without cheap oil. </p></li></ol></li></ol><p>If you disagree, that is completely fine. I respect you and your opinion just the same. However, if you want to argue in the comments, please present valid reasoning….not an angry message, as I will just ignore those. As an ex-Navy Officer and having started my content journey on TikTok…I have <strong>thick skin </strong>and couldn’t care less lol. </p><p>Now, transitioning over to <strong>gold (and silver)</strong>, I remain bullish that we are still just consolidating. A primary reason I am still bullish on gold and silver, I mentioned above: I expect more chaos and more catalysts, that these assets have yet to price in. Some institution, somewhere, will know about these negative events before you and I. They will get into things like gold and silver, further driving prices up. </p><p>Additionally, when we look at the monthly timeframe, this is the first real pullback/consolidation. Even at its worse (in March), bulls came in bought ate up the selling action. I think a reasonable approach to flip bearish would be if price sinks below $4145 and closes below between now and the end of May. Until then, price action is trending fine (again, on the longer timeframes). If you want to check out the silver miner stock we picked up, <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/i-said-gold-and-silver-are-not-done?r=4z8lgl\">Check out this article</a>.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rNIZ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39d63197-5d85-495b-9727-320ff9211fd3_1409x859.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rNIZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39d63197-5d85-495b-9727-320ff9211fd3_1409x859.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rNIZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39d63197-5d85-495b-9727-320ff9211fd3_1409x859.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rNIZ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39d63197-5d85-495b-9727-320ff9211fd3_1409x859.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rNIZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39d63197-5d85-495b-9727-320ff9211fd3_1409x859.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rNIZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39d63197-5d85-495b-9727-320ff9211fd3_1409x859.png\" width=\"1409\" height=\"859\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/39d63197-5d85-495b-9727-320ff9211fd3_1409x859.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:859,&quot;width&quot;:1409,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:112771,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRe